```uvl
include
    Boolean.group-cardinality
    Arithmetic.aggregate-function
    Arithmetic.feature-cardinality
    Type.string-constraints

features
    Pizza
        mandatory
            Base {Price 2.0}
            Sauce
                alternative
                    Tomato {Price 0.8}
                    "Creme Fraiche" {Price 1.1}
            Integer Size
        optional
            Cheese
                or
                    Mozzarella {Price 0.4}
                    Cheddar {Price 0.6}
            Toppings
                [1..3]
                    Mushrooms {Price 0.5}
                    Onion {Price 0.3}
                    Olive {Price 0.3}
                    Pineapple {Price 0.8}
            "Delivery Address" cardinality [1..10]
                mandatory
                    String Street
                    String City

constraints
    !("Creme Fraiche" & Cheddar)
    sum(Price) < 5
    Size > 20
    Size < 60
    City == 'Omashu'
    len(Street) < 100
```